---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  active="blog"
  title="Blog — AgentStateDeveloper"
  description="Notes on code-level context, effects, and audit for agent-authored code."
  url="https://agentstatedeveloper.dev/blog/"
>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot">●</span> Blog //</span>
    <h1>Notes from the <span style="color:var(--accent-bright)">overlay</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Writing on code-level context, effect propagation, and keeping agent-authored code accountable. The first posts are on the way.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="blog-list" data-reveal>
      <div class="empty-note">
        <div class="big">No posts yet — but the ideas are queued.</div>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px">We're drafting the first entries: why the diff isn't enough for agents, how transitive effect propagation works, and what a hash-chained audit trail buys you in an incident. Until they land, the docs are the best place to go deep.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/guides/introduction/">Read the docs →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper" target="_blank">Follow on GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Site>
